 "formatText": "Answer in the JSON form the request enforces. Text fields are plain text, without Markdown.\nA field name with an underscore is a part of one item: plan_stopPrice is the stop price of the plan, execution_cancelIf is the cancel conditions of the execution.\nWhere there is no value, write 0 for a number, an empty string for text, an empty list for a list, and none where the choices include it. A stop price, target price, number of holding days or execution bound of 0 means none.\nNo portfolio comparison: plan_portfolioImpact_why is empty. No valuation: plan_valuation_method is empty. No execution instruction: execution_bound 0, execution_cancelAfter empty and execution_cancelIf empty. No reversal: reversal_basis none.\nstrategyCheck is JSON written as text in that string, matching this JSON Schema, or an empty string when there is nothing: {\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"horizon\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"long-term\",\"swing\",\"short-term\"]},\"instrument\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"unleveraged\",\"leveraged\",\"inverse\"]},\"direction\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"long\",\"short\"]},\"funding\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"cash\",\"margin\"]},\"idea\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"acted\",\"watching\",\"rejected\",\"none-found\",\"not-permitted\",\"carried\"]},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"horizon\",\"instrument\",\"direction\",\"funding\",\"idea\",\"verdict\",\"reason\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"maxItems\":8}\nscoutBrief is JSON written as text in that string, matching this JSON Schema, or an empty string when there is nothing: {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"request\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"none\",\"note\",\"run\"]},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"lookingFor\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"avoid\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"questions\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"feedback\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"symbol\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"acted\",\"passed\",\"waiting\"]},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"symbol\",\"verdict\",\"reason\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"request\",\"reason\",\"lookingFor\",\"avoid\",\"questions\",\"feedback\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}\nplanVerdicts is JSON written as text in that string, matching this JSON Schema, or an empty string when there is nothing: {\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"symbol\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"acted\",\"waiting\",\"passed\"]},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"condition\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"market\",\"data\",\"event\",\"none\"]},\"unresolved\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"recheck\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"waitReason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"market_closed\",\"publication_pending\",\"entry_condition\",\"missing_data\",\"none\"]},\"earliestCheck\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"unresolved\",\"evidence\",\"recheck\",\"waitReason\",\"earliestCheck\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"dataGap\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"material\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"why\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"otherSource\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"alternative\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retry\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"metric\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"period\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"document\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"cause\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"not-yet-published\",\"not-retrievable\",\"insufficient\"]}},\"required\":[\"material\",\"why\",\"otherSource\",\"alternative\",\"retry\",\"metric\",\"period\",\"document\",\"cause\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"minimumPosition\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"bull\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"base\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\